graph TD
    subgraph OnPrem_Legacy ["On-Premises Healthcare Data Center"]
        MSSQL["Microsoft SQL Server (2016)<br/>• EHR & Clinical Records<br/>• Transaction Log Enabled"]
        MySQL["MySQL Database (5.7)<br/>• Telehealth & Scheduling Logs<br/>• Binlog Enabled"]
        Hist_Dump["Historical Archive Data (5+ Years)<br/>• CSV / BCP / Parquet Exports"]
    end

    subgraph AWS_Migration_Services ["AWS Database Migration & Ingestion Engine"]
        SCT["AWS Schema Conversion Tool (SCT)<br/>Converts T-SQL / Stored Procedures to PL/pgSQL"]
        DMS_Rep["AWS DMS Replication Instance (Multi-AZ)<br/>• dms.r5.xlarge Instance<br/>• Automated Multi-AZ Failover"]
        
        subgraph DMS_Tasks ["Active DMS Tasks"]
            Task_Full["Full Load Task<br/>Bulk Historic Tables"]
            Task_CDC["Continuous CDC Task<br/>Ongoing Transaction Replication (<2s Latency)"]
        end

        S3_Staging["Amazon S3: Migration Staging Bucket<br/>(Raw Encrypted BCP / CSV Dumps)"]
    end

    subgraph Glue_Validation_Pipeline ["Data Transformation & Integrity Validation"]
        Glue_Job["AWS Glue PySpark ETL Job<br/>• Data Cleansing & Deduplication<br/>• Parquet Conversion & Snappy Compression<br/>• Partitioning by Year/Month"]
        Checksum_Engine["Cryptographic Integrity Engine<br/>• SHA-256 Row & Column Hashing<br/>• Row Count Reconciliation<br/>• Schema Drift Detection"]
        Glue_Catalog["AWS Glue Data Catalog<br/>(Unified Metadata Repository)"]
    end

    subgraph Target_Persistence ["Target Production Cloud Persistence"]
        Aurora["Amazon Aurora PostgreSQL (Multi-AZ)<br/>• Primary Production Healthcare Database<br/>• Sub-second Read Replicas"]
        S3_Lake["Amazon S3 Medical Data Lake<br/>• Partitioned Apache Parquet<br/>• SSE-KMS Encrypted<br/>• S3 Glacier Lifecycle Transition"]
    end

    %% Flow connections
    MSSQL & MySQL -.->|Schema Extraction| SCT
    SCT -.->|Deploy Schemas| Aurora

    MSSQL & MySQL -->|Replication Source| DMS_Rep
    DMS_Rep --> Task_Full & Task_CDC
    Task_Full & Task_CDC -->|Target Load| Aurora

    Hist_Dump -->|AWS DataSync / Direct Connect| S3_Staging
    S3_Staging --> Glue_Job
    Glue_Job --> Checksum_Engine
    Checksum_Engine -->|Validated Parquet| S3_Lake
    Glue_Job --> Glue_Catalog

    %% Verification Loop
    Aurora -.->|Integrity Validation Query| Checksum_Engine
